{
  "catalogue": "medsync.test-catalogue",
  "version": "1.0.0-draft",
  "hospital_id": null,
  "status": "DRAFT. Default starter menu (hospital_id null) for OPD and emergency care at a Ugandan regional or national referral hospital; each facility edits its own copy.",
  "notes": [
    "No reference ranges: every result carries the performing laboratory's own range (MS-EMR-CLIN-001 7.3).",
    "turnaround_target_minutes is an operational target set by each facility; null in this default menu.",
    "panelComponents use clinical-fact-concepts v1 ids plus the v1.1 extension ids in MS-EMR-CLIN-001 [08]; defaultUnits are the canonical units from those sources (quantity concepts only).",
    "container uses the CFC v1 container enum and is null where the right container is outside it: sodium citrate (INR/PT, D-dimer; ESR by method), blood culture bottles, and sterile urine or sputum containers. Proposed v1.1 enum extension.",
    "specimenType uses the CFC v1 specimen enum; \"sputum\" is outside it and needs the same extension.",
    "Specimen and container are the common defaults; each facility laboratory confirms its own (for example troponin on lithium heparin, CrAg on plasma or CSF).",
    "capability_id links a test to a v1 facility capability only where one fits exactly; FBC is left null because cap.haemoglobin covers haemoglobin alone."
  ],
